Could you put the status of the Lojban project and its subprojects on
the web page, and update it quarterly? It made me wonder if Lojab was
still alive when I saw '1997' as the last year updated. I could
certainly prepare html for this on my own time and then give a web
address you could check before uploading to the main site. I think
having frequently updating 'Status' encourages people interested in
Lojban. It is also a good way to get other people to volunteer. You
might want to check http://www.gnu.org for a similar approach. Again,
I'd like to volunteer to do a monthly or at least quarterly status of
Lojban and put this online.


